## Hotel Descriptions (as supplied by the property data)

### 1. La Quinta by Wyndham Waxahachie  
> “Featuring a seasonal outdoor pool, this Waxahachie, Texas hotel is 5 minutes’ walk to Lumpkin Stadium. A free breakfast buffet is offered daily. Free Wi‑Fi, cable TV and an en‑suite bathroom are offered in all rooms at La Quinta Inn & Suites Waxahachie. Coffee‑making facilities are also provided. After a day of activity, guests can enjoy a hot tub onsite. A launderette and fitness centre are also available at Waxahachie La Quinta Inn & Suites. Southwestern Assemblies of God University is 5 minutes’ drive away; Meacham International Airport is about 1 hour’s drive away.”  

**Key amenities** – Free Wi‑Fi, complimentary breakfast, outdoor pool, hot tub, free parking, pet‑friendly (2 pets max, $25 USD per night, non‑refundable), coffee maker, cable TV, fitness centre, laundry.  
**Address** – 2000 S Main St., Waxahachie, TX 75165, United States.  
**Rating** – 7.3 / 10 (Good) based on 980 reviews.

### 2. La Quinta by Wyndham Dallas Duncanville  
> “La Quinta by Wyndham Dallas Duncanville is situated in Duncanville, 21 km from the Sixth Floor Museum and 22 km from the John F. Kennedy Memorial. With a fitness centre, the 3‑star hotel has air‑conditioned rooms with free Wi‑Fi, each with a private bathroom. The hotel has an indoor pool and shared lounge, and Dallas Zoo is 17 km away. All rooms have a desk and a TV, plus bed‑linen and towels. Staff speak English, Spanish, Gujarati and Hindi at the reception. Dallas Holocaust Museum and Dallas World Aquarium are each about 22 km away.”  

**Key amenities** – Free Wi‑Fi, complimentary breakfast, indoor heated pool, fitness centre, free parking, work desk, flat‑screen TV, multilingual front desk (English, Spanish, Gujarati, Hindi).  
**Address** – 2000 S Main St., Duncanville, TX 75116, United States.  
**Rating** – 8.7 / 10 (Fabulous) based on 915 reviews.

